Package: subtivals
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: A program to project subtitles (*.ass, *.srt, *.txt, *.xml).
 Subtivals is the perfect tool to add subtitles for live performances.
 It projects captions automatically with full control, and is used by
 cinema festivals, theaters and operas worldwide.
